        "char_yao_huang",
        "sys_gu_formation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Outside Lang Ya’s cloud building he casts wind escape, vanishes as wind, then reappears to cut with death wind flying blade; Fang Yuan recognizes the move and identifies him as Hui Feng Zi.",
      "chapters": [
        877
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "recognition-and-recasts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the later fight he flees again with wind escape when strength path giant hands slam down.",
      "chapters": [
        885
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "recognition-and-recasts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During the Central Continent breakout he casts it once more, surging ahead of Jiang Yu’s group for a few breaths before coordinated Gu formations and pursuers slow him.",
